# VS Code has no official Arch package (AUR: visual-studio-code-bin needs an
# AUR helper or a manual makepkg build), so this module contributes nothing
# on arch -- see modules/vscode/module.sh. The file exists so the P4.2
# list-usability gate passes explicitly. Use FS_VSCODE_FLATPAK=1 for the
# flatpak build.
